### 智能代办助手 API 测试
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行
### 基础URL: http://localhost:3000/api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@contentType = application/json

# ============================================
# 用户认证模块
# ============================================

### 1. 用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "测试用户"
}

### 2. 用户登录
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 登录（获取Token用于后续请求）
# 成功后，复制返回的 token 到下面的 @token 变量
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

# 从登录响应中提取 token（需要手动复制）
# @token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...

# ============================================
# 待办管理模块（需要认证）
# ============================================

### 4. 创建待办
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "title": "完成项目文档",
  "description": "编写API文档和使用说明",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "工作",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-25"
}

### 5. 创建待办（中等优先级）
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "title": "购买生活用品",
  "description": "去超市买牛奶和面包",
  "priority": "medium",
  "category": "生活",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-20"
}

### 6. 创建待办（低优先级）
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "title": "阅读技术文章",
  "description": "学习React新特性",
  "priority": "low",
  "category": "学习",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-30"
}

### 7. 获取所有待办
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 8. 获取待办（筛选：已完成）
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?completed=true
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 9. 获取待办（筛选：高优先级）
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 10. 获取待办（筛选：工作分类）
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?category=工作
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 11. 更新待办（标记完成）
# 注意：将 {todoId} 替换为实际的待办ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{todoId}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "completed": true
}

### 12. 更新待办（修改内容）
# 注意：将 {todoId} 替换为实际的待办ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{todoId}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "title": "更新后的标题",
  "description": "更新后的描述",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-06-01"
}

### 13. 删除待办
# 注意：将 {todoId} 替换为实际的待办ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{todoId}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# ============================================
# 数据看板模块（需要认证）
# ============================================

### 14. 获取统计概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 15. 获取趋势数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/trends
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 16. 获取分类统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# ============================================
# 错误测试用例
# ============================================

### 17. 注册（邮箱已存在）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 18. 注册（邮箱格式错误）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 19. 注册（密码太短）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "new@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 20. 登录（密码错误）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 21. 访问受保护路由（无Token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos

### 22. 访问受保护路由（无效Token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 23. 创建待办（缺少必填字段）
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "description": "没有标题的待办"
}

### 24. 更新不存在的待办
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "title": "不存在的待办"
}

### 25. 删除不存在的待办
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
